{"channelId":"UC6wkYO71NNjsVZWLNfRKpHQ","row":["SLUCare",32200,"SLUCare Physician Group is the academic medical practice of Saint Louis University, with more than 500 health care providers and 1,200 staff members in hospitals and medical offices throughout the St. Louis region.\n\nOur physicians are among the most highly trained in their fields: more than 50 specialties in all. We have national and international experts, renowned for research and innovations in medicine.\n\nIn addition to treating patients, SLUCare physicians educate the next generation of health care professionals at Saint Louis University School of Medicine. Our teaching is guided by our Catholic Jesuit tradition, balancing the science of medicine with the soul of it — keeping people first in all we do.\n\nVideos on this channel are for informational purposes only and do not replace a personal consultation with a physician. If you have questions about the topic presented here, please schedule an appointment. Medical questions will not be addressed in the Comments.","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC6wkYO71NNjsVZWLNfRKpHQ","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC6wkYO71NNjsVZWLNfRKpHQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:18:40.056Z","channelId":"UC6wkYO71NNjsVZWLNfRKpHQ","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"a1e6e08b4f8032945ef6d2237f20d4baa8c92609686cd521eb78dfa8857fc0e4","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"ba22b4337bf80881013a4802d1278776646443bcccc79db944477adcb900bede"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC6wkYO71NNjsVZWLNfRKpHQ","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":32200,"raw":"32.2K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC6wkYO71NNjsVZWLNfRKpHQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:18:40.056Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"physical therapist","rel